option.HARDCODED_SSS                   = Hardcoded SSS
option.HARDCODED_SSS.comment           = Hardcoded dispersione di superfice per alcuni blocchi (es foglie)
option.RAIN_PUDDLES                    = Pozzanghere
option.RAIN_PUDDLES.comment = Controls rain puddles.
option.RAIN_PUDDLES_MODE               = Modalità pozze d'acqua
option.RAIN_PUDDLES_MODE.comment = Controls when rain puddles appear. OFF disables. RAIN shows puddles only when it's raining. EVERYWHERE shows puddles in any biome (even ones that don't normally get rain).
value.RAIN_PUDDLES_OFF                 = Spento
value.RAIN_PUDDLES_RAIN                = Pioggia
